+/* The early 10G-QXGMII bring-up of qcom,early-10g-qxgmii, then the UNIPHY0
+ * monitors. They start only here, so they never read UNIPHY0 or the XPCS
+ * while this bring-up has the PLL or the XPCS in reset.
+ */
