+/**
+ * ipq_pcs_stock_soc_up() - stock order: bring UNIPHY0 up for 10G-QXGMII now
+ * @cal_done: set to the time the UNIPHY calibration finished, 0 if none
+ *
+ * Called by the QCA8084 driver right before its UQXGMII mode set. Runs the
+ * bring-up that qcom,early-10g-qxgmii does at probe without stock_order, at
+ * most once per boot; later calls return the first result. If it cannot run,
